        "body": "<div>Booked by Jaymes Paolo Rombaoa jaymesrombaoa@gmail.com Please share anything that will help prepare for our meeting. Question about Avicenna features, more customization options for notifications. What if you have groups of participants (e.g., 2-3 members of a family) and want the notifications to be semi-random, but exactly the same for these 3 people?\n\nOther Qs about customizing UI/UX — can there be more than 1 Question per screen?</div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\" style=\"width:100%;\"><tbody><tr><td align=\"left\">\n<div> </div>\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\" style=\"width:100%;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"border: solid 1px #dadce0; padding: 24px 32px; text-align: center; vertical-align: top;\">\n<div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top;padding:0;\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tr><td style=\" padding: 0; text-align: left;padding-bottom:28px;\">\n<a href=\"https://meet.google.com/mrk-wqwb-zkv?hs=224\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://meet.google.com/mrk-wqwb-zkv?hs=224\" target=\"_blank\"></a><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr><td align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\" style=\"background-color: #1a73e8; padding: 10px 25px; border: none; margin: 0;\">Join with Google Meet</td></tr></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\" padding: 0; text-align: left;padding-bottom:24px;\"><div>\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"padding-bottom: 4px;\"><tr><td><h2>Meeting link</h2></td></tr></table>\n<div style=\"color: #70757a;\"><a href=\"https://meet.google.com/mrk-wqwb-zkv?hs=224\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://meet.google.com/mrk-wqwb-zkv?hs=224\" target=\"_blank\">meet.google.com/mrk-wqwb-zkv</a></div>\n</div></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\" padding: 0; text-align: left;padding-bottom:24px;\"><div>\n<a href=\"https://meet.google.com/mrk-wqwb-zkv?hs=224\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://meet.google.com/mrk-wqwb-zkv?hs=224\" target=\"_blank\">Test your setup</a> <span style=\"color: #70757a;\">any time before your appointment.</span>\n</div></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\" padding: 0; text-align: left;padding-bottom:24px;\"><div>\n<div>\n<div style=\"color: #70757a;\">New to Google Meet?</div>\n<a href=\"https://support.google.com/a/users/answer/9282720\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://support.google.com/a/users/answer/9282720\" target=\"_blank\">Learn more</a> <span style=\"color: #70757a;\">about getting started.</span>\n</div>\n<br><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"padding-bottom: 4px;\"><tr><td><h2>Join by phone</h2></td></tr></table>\n<span style=\"color: #70757a;\">(US) </span><a href=\"tel:+1-443-424-3660%3B279591297%23\">+1 443-424-3660</a> <br><span style=\"color: #70757a;\">PIN: 279591297</span><br><br><a href=\"https://tel.meet/mrk-wqwb-zkv?pin=5537985102004&amp;hs=0\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://tel.meet/mrk-wqwb-zkv?pin=5537985102004&amp;hs=0\" target=\"_blank\">More phone numbers</a><br>\n</div></td></tr>\n</table></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"padding-right: 32px; padding-left: 0;width:100%;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:0; vertical-align:top;\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tr><td style=\" padding: 0; text-align: left;padding-bottom:2px;\"><div style=\"color: #3c4043;\">Meeting with Avicenna (Amin Tavassolian) (Jaymes Paolo Rombaoa)</div></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\" padding: 0; text-align: left;padding-bottom:24px;\"><div style=\"color: #3c4043;\">\n<span><time datetime=\"20240923T170000Z\"></time><time datetime=\"20240923T173000Z\"></time></span>Monday Sep 23, 2024 ⋅ 10am – 10:30am (Pacific Time - Los Angeles) </div></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\" padding: 0; text-align: left;padding-bottom:24px;\"><div style=\"color: #3c4043;\"><span><b>Booked by</b><br>Jaymes Paolo Rombaoa<br><a href=\"mailto:jaymesrombaoa@gmail.com\">jaymesrombaoa@gmail.com</a><br><br><b>Please share anything that will help prepare for our meeting.</b><br>Question about Avicenna features, more customization options for notifications. What if you have groups of participants (e.g., 2-3 members of a family) and want the notifications to be semi-random, but exactly the same for these 3 people?<p>Other Qs about customizing UI/UX — can there be more than 1 Question per screen?</p></span></div></td></tr>\n</table></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\" style=\"width:100%;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\" padding: 0; text-align: left;padding:4px 12px;\" align=\"left\"><div style=\"color: #70757a;\">\n<p>Powered by <a href=\"https://workspace.google.com/resources/appointment-scheduling/\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://workspace.google.com/resources/appointment-scheduling/\" target=\"_blank\">Google Calendar appointment scheduling</a>. Use is subject to the <a href=\"https://policies.google.com/privacy\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://policies.google.com/privacy\" target=\"_blank\">Google Privacy Policy</a> and <a href=\"https://policies.google.com/terms\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://policies.google.com/terms\" target=\"_blank\">Terms of Service</a>.</p>\n<p>You are receiving this email because you are included on the guest list for this booked appointment.</p>\n<p>Forwarding this invitation could allow any recipient to cancel on your behalf.</p>\n</div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>",
